### Get a delivery quote
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/quote?dropoffAddress=3590 Boul Notre dame, Laval, QC H7V 3Z7
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a sandbox delivery
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/delivery
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "woocommerceOrderId": "TEST-001",
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "customerAddress": "3590 Boul Notre dame, Laval, QC, H7V 3Z7",
  "customerPhone": "+15141234567",
  "orderValueCents": "2500"
}

###

### Test idempotency — same order ID, should throw
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/delivery
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "woocommerceOrderId": "TEST-001",
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "customerAddress": "456 Test St, Montreal, QC H2X 1Y6",
  "customerPhone": "+15141234567",
  "orderValueCents": "2500"
}

###

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health